-- American, Indian, Japanese, Korean, Italian, French, Mexican, Peruvian,
-- Chinese, Thai and Burmese mains, plus the drinks that go with them —
-- coffee, tea, and one alcoholic entry per region.
--
-- Portions are what a counter or a kitchen actually hands you rather than a
-- label serving, because nobody eats two thirds of a croissant. Composed
-- dishes are estimated from their components at restaurant portion sizes; the
-- single-ingredient rows earlier in this file remain the accurate ones.
-- ===========================================================================

